To design an end-user API for 3D camera animation in TypeScript, follow these steps:

1. Define the API's endpoint:
```typescript
export interface CameraAnimationApi {
  url: string;
}
```

2. Create a service to handle the API requests:
```typescript
import axios from 'axios';

export class CameraAnimationService {
  private api: CameraAnimationApi;

  constructor(api: CameraAnimationApi) {
    this.api = api;
  }

  async fetchAnimation(animationId: string): Promise<any> {
    try {
      const response = await axios.get(`${this.api.url}/animation/${animationId}`);
      return response.data;
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Error fetching animation:', error);
      throw error;
    }
  }
}
```

3. Create a component to consume the API:
```typescript
