The formula to calculate the percentage of refund is:

(Refund Amount / Purchase Price) * 100%

In your example, the refund amount is $600, the purchase price is $1000, and the residual value is $200. The calculation would be:

(600 / 1000) * 100% = 60%

So, the seller is refunding 60% of the purchase price.

